<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli air forces have intensified strikes in Lebanon, hitting Hezbollah rockets, launchers in the Beqaa Valley and targets in eastern Lebanon. Hezbollah’s leader again demanded the release of five detained operatives and rejected any post-UNIFIL force outside U.N. authority, while Iran’s support for Hezbollah was reaffirmed. The two sides are preparing for an eighth round of peace talks before year-end. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/world/unhcr-global-appeal-2027&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOOTVUMWtzR3dQbDRITTBRbkNXWkliX3FXSGxyQkhIcGo3WnpxbC0xZTdvT21JNTZ3bGVnTVJKM0NvUVVKQlNCamY0bHpCQS1oN21UaWo4N2JBWlRvZFJrenhNWXZqTjZmX2FrVEY4OWlhOWllUTZUY1l5MEUtRE41R0RXd2ZlT21QWkJ1TENuUlJTcDdZczFxVVR3TF9CekxGRXRYYXJfM25FbjBOZHA3SzZiX19lZ0xHNGlnR05DRFNKeVV2ejJJWWpRNjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQZ2prUV9rQkNfSXAtQmNaSHlBWUVleTBoWkgzLWN4X1llNkJBaWJ0NjJlbTBPYUpmTDNQNXpBZjVTTnVEOHNvSm52RjIxeHhxYjZiQ3NXOUNNbEkwd1pELXh0eDNXLWtOTlVMVWxWOVpvbENxaVZxd0lXMlRIa0laSkNsSV82eUl6YXFVVVpsQlRVVVRPSGZj?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/world/mixed-migration-review-2026-migration-age-polycrisis&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/world/legal-identity-displaced-people-west-and-central-africa-reform-effective-access-turning-political-commitment-protection-outcomes&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/syrian-arab-republic/unhcr-syria-operational-update-october-2026&quot;